    <briefdescription>
<para>Result slot of one search worker: the documents of the matching files, the match count, and the failures. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One job writes one slot at a time, so the jobs search in parallel with no lock. The slots are read after every job has finished. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
